    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Parse four ``Accept*`` headers used in server-driven content negotiation.

The four headers are ``Accept``, ``Accept-Charset``, ``Accept-Encoding`` and
``Accept-Language``.
</verbatim> </para>
